{"seq":2,"slug":"contact-friction-models","title":"接触模型与摩擦锥","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation/grasp-mechanics/contact-friction-models","wordCount":1401,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"接触模型与摩擦锥\">接触模型与摩擦锥</h1><p><a href=\"force-form-closure\">力封闭与形封闭</a>告诉我们一组接触能否锁住物体，但它把&quot;接触&quot;当成了理想的力旋量来源。真正决定一个接触点能传递哪些力的，是接触的物理模型——它是只能推的点？能传切向摩擦力的硬指？还是能扭转的软指？以及摩擦究竟允许多大的切向力。本篇把这些前提补齐：接触类型决定可行力旋量的形状，摩擦锥决定其边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>机器人抓取分析中，接触按其能传递的力旋量分量分为三类经典模型。无摩擦点接触（PwoF）只能沿法向推；有摩擦点接触（PwF，硬指）能传递法向力加两个切向摩擦力；软指接触（SF）在此基础上再加一个绕法向的摩擦扭矩。模型越丰富，单个接触约束物体的能力越强，所需接触点越少。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[接触建模] --&gt; B[无摩擦点接触 PwoF]&#10;    A --&gt; C[有摩擦点接触 PwF 硬指]&#10;    A --&gt; D[软指接触 SF]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[只传法向力&lt;br/&gt;1个分量]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[法向力+2切向摩擦力&lt;br/&gt;3个分量 摩擦锥约束]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[再加绕法向摩擦力矩&lt;br/&gt;4个分量 椭球约束]&#10;    C1 --&gt; E[库仑摩擦律&lt;br/&gt;切向力受锥约束]&#10;    D1 --&gt; E\">flowchart TD\n    A[接触建模] --&gt; B[无摩擦点接触 PwoF]\n    A --&gt; C[有摩擦点接触 PwF 硬指]\n    A --&gt; D[软指接触 SF]\n    B --&gt; B1[只传法向力&lt;br/&gt;1个分量]\n    C --&gt; C1[法向力+2切向摩擦力&lt;br/&gt;3个分量 摩擦锥约束]\n    D --&gt; D1[再加绕法向摩擦力矩&lt;br/&gt;4个分量 椭球约束]\n    C1 --&gt; E[库仑摩擦律&lt;br/&gt;切向力受锥约束]\n    D1 --&gt; E</pre><p>下表给出三类模型可传递的力旋量分量及其约束：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>接触模型</th>\n<th>可传递分量</th>\n<th>约束形式</th>\n<th>自由度贡献</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无摩擦点接触 PwoF</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_n \\ge 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>单射线（非负法向）</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有摩擦点接触 PwF</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_n, f_{t1}, f_{t2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><spa